WEBVTT

00:00:00.142 --> 00:00:04.558
Quick start: run naimix and call it.

00:00:04.558 --> 00:00:13.362
Start the demo backend in one terminal.

00:00:13.362 --> 00:00:26.522
Start naimix in another.

00:00:26.522 --> 00:00:30.529
Call a route. The backend returns its own shape; naimix returns yours.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:34.530
Same route, an XML backend.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.035
Same shape, whatever the backend.

00:00:36.039 --> 00:00:46.192
Open the Developer Console next.
